{"seq":19,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-conservative-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/sy-02-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T07:57:51.130Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"f9dc9700a6bc90b687d88b1940008c2332020ca827b48bbed7d1606fe1ef6a59","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I found two Marrow Fieldworks tickets for certain and one more that probably belongs to it.\n\n*Clearly Marrow Fieldworks*\n• *#4409*: recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, during the 06:00 flatbed intake). Source: Moss's digest \"Central handoffs next week\" (teams/team-central/digests/2026-01-02-central-handoffs.md). It says Hollis flagged it before the 5 Jan 2026 handoff.\n• *#4412*: driver SMS prompt glitch when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots. Same digest, same flag from Hollis.\n\n*Probably Marrow Fieldworks (please check)*\n• *#8841*: West yard Door 2 double-books when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk. Source: your own message in #central-random on 13 Oct at 09:27. In that thread Hollis calls it \"Tobias's dealer account\" and never names the account. The handoff digest calls Marrow Fieldworks \"Pree's dealer account\" before 5 Jan, so it's likely the same account after it moved to you. Nothing I found says so outright.\n\n*Not included*\n• FR-882 (pallet-jack icons) is a feature request from *Marrow Agrisupply*, a different account. Same digest.\n• Moss's Central cheat sheet only says \"door 4 msg\" under Marrow Agrisupply, with no ticket number.\n\nI searched every Moss digest you can see (Central and North) and all of #central-random. Neither mentions any other Marrow Fieldworks ticket."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
